"Write to `$env:TEMP`, `$env:LOCALAPPDATA`, or an absolute path under the "
"user's profile instead. Even for `run_as: system` (where SYSTEM can write to "
"its own staged dir), the directory is cleaned up when the script exits, so "
"writing siblings is fragile either way."
msgstr ""

